# A message's words held still half a second are picked: 引用 puts them into the draft as a quote, its comment line
# takes the comment; sent together. (The agent is asked for something to quote first: what the chat opens on.)
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
tap 发消息
type 再回答一句 {T} post:这句话会被引用 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
timeout 120000
untiln 2 这句话会被引用 {T}
# (its turn ends just after: the all-done card comes under the answer and moves the list; held once it is in)
until 归档此对话
timeout 60000
hold 700 这句话会被引用 {T}
until =引用
shot 1-picked
tap =引用
until 添加说明
shot 2-quoted
tap 添加说明
type 对这条回复的说明 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
until 对这条回复的说明 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 3-sent
